e round-1 winner\nElements: greeting = \"Hi,\" · sender = \"it's Dr. {NAME}'s office.\" ·\n  news = \"New prescription details\" · ask = \"require your review:\" ·\n  link = \"{LINK}\" · opt-out = \"Reply STOP to opt-out\"\nDesign theory: the board's message theories <- design-theory.md\n\nTask · Design-01-all-patients-prescription-review-sms\nMethod: By insight   (proposed: one method per page)", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_files-folder", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2590.0, "y": 4705.0, "width": 1140.0, "height": 450.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 853374070, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 971058503, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 0, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_files-folder-h", "type": "text", "x": 2615.0, "y": 4727.5, "width": 249.90000000000003, "height": 32.8125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1163932844, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1632054755, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 0, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The Design Folder", "originalText": "The Design Folder", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_files-folder-b", "type": "text", "x": 2615.0, "y": 4777.5, "width": 780.0, "height": 243.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupId